\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Lord, grant us, like the watching five,
\par To wait Thy coming,and to strive
\par Each one her lamp to trim;
\par And, since the oil Thou dost impart,
\par Pour daily grace into each heart,
\par Lest any lamp grow dim.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. May we not wait in selfish sloth,
\par But mingle prayer and work, that both
\par May trim the shining light;
\par So frm the midnight of their sin
\par May many, with us, enter in,
\par To banquet in Thy sight.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. We would not come alone, dear Lord,
\par To Thy great feast, and at Thy board
\par In rapture sit and gaze;
\par But bring the lost, the sick, the lone,
\par The little ones to be Thine own,
\par And look into Thy face.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

